ollowing position : Department of Marketing - Part-time Lecturer(s) (Ref: PTL (MKT) 2026-10-09) Responsibilities The appointee(s) will be responsible for teaching Marketing courses at the undergraduate level such as Social Media Marketing, AI and E-Marketing and/or Principles of Marketing and commit to daytime teaching on weekdays (Monday to Friday). Applicants Should possess an advanced degree, preferably in Marketing or a related discipline; have solid teaching experience in tertiary education; and possess relevant industry experience preferably. .................................................................................................................................................................. The appointee is expected to assume duty in January 2027. Salary will be commensurate with qualifications and experience. Interested applicants should visit this link https://recruit.hsu.edu.hk/ and apply on or before 25 October 2026 . Review of applications will begin soon and continue until the position is filled. The University reserves the right not to fill the position in this exercise. Applicants who are not invited to an interview within three months may consider their applications unsuccessful.  All information received will be treated in strict confidence, and the data collected will be used for recruitment purposes only.  The Personal Information Collection Statement will be provided upon request. The Hang Seng University of Hong Kong, incorporated in Hong Kong with limited liability by guarantee, is an equal opportunity employer. Apply Now!"
