lication for the Research Project “ ESG research in corporate finance ” , funded the Research Matching Grant Scheme: Part-time Research Assistant (Part-time) – Research Centre for ESG (Ref: RA (CESG - GRSG(AB)-252627-B09A12) 2026-10-16) Responsibilities support research activities including literature review, data collection, results write-up, and prepare research reports; organise and coordinate industry related activities, such as conferences, workshops, meetings, etc; and support other research-related tasks for the project. Applicants Should possess a master’s degree, preferably in relevant business disciplines; have basic knowledge of green finance, including sustainable finance in the hospitality sector and climate-risk management; have a good command of written and spoken English and Chinese; and be able to work independently. .................................................................................................................................................................. This employment is initially on a 12-month contract and is renewable subject to performance review and mutual agreement. Salary will be commensurate with qualifications and experience. Interested applicant should visit this link https://recruit.hsu.edu.hk/ and apply on or before 25 October 2026 .  The University reserves the right not to fill the position in this exercise. Applicants who are not invited to an interview within three months may consider their applications unsuccessful.  All information received will be treated in strict confidence, and the data collected will be used for recruitment purpose s only .  The Personal Information Collection Statement will be provided upon request. The Hang Seng University of Hong Kong, incorporated in Hong Kong with limited liability by guarantee, is an equal opportunity employer. Apply Now!"
